  "title": "Product Search Indexes: Lucene, Elasticsearch and Azure AI Search | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A listing searches your database by default. For a large catalog, or when the best match should come first, a listing can search a search server instead. This video shows the three steps: turn on a product search feature, create the index under Search, Indexes, and choose it on the listing, and what visitors see.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why a search index, and the three steps: feature, index, listing\n• Turning on Product Search (Lucene)\n• Creating the index under Search, Indexes\n• Choosing the index on the listing\n• What visitors see, the database fallback and the other engines",
